<section id="about" class="py-16 sm:py-24">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight text-[#12232e] sm:text-4xl mb-4">
        About Me
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
        17 years building documentation systems that hold up under pressure. At Salesforce,
        I built and shipped 10 production AI tools for a writing team of 8 — RAG-grounded,
        MCP-connected, agentic. At Intel, I owned developer documentation for OpenVINO and
        Tiber Edge AI platforms. Across roles, the throughline is the same: documentation
        systems built to move at the speed of the product, and the AI tooling to make that
        possible at scale.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid gap-6 sm:gap-8 grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
      {skills.map((skill) => (
         <div class="p-4 sm:p-6 rounded-xl bg-white/80 backdrop-blur-sm border border-[#4DA8DA]/20 hover:border-[#4DA8DA]/50 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-br from-[#4DA8DA]/15 to-[#EEFBFB]
                      flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
